    "description": "Sun-drenched 1940s corner home with timeless appeal nestled on the quiet east slope of Bernal Heights. With south, east, and west exposures, natural light pours into every room, enhancing the home's warm and inviting ambiance. Thoughtfully updated while maintaining its vintage character, this three-bedroom gem boasts an airy layout with hardwood floors, classic period details, and modern conveniences.  The spacious full basement includes a versatile bonus room, offering endless possibilities for a home office, gym, or creative space, with expansion potential to suit your needs, along with spacious garage with interior access to the home. A delightful garden, brimming with lush greenery and mature plantings, provides a tranquil outdoor oasis for relaxation and entertaining. Located on a peaceful, tucked away corner, yet just moments from Precita and Bernal Heights Parks, and Cortland Avenue's vibrant shops & eateries, this is Bernal Heights living at its finestcharming, sunlit, and filled with opportunity.  New roof, new paint, refinished floors, and many upgrades."
  },
